  Version 20261102.3~sparky9~0 (2026-11-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Map edition and legacy Oxygen scheme names to the light and dark Oxygen GTK themes; keep Kubabbar Glass and other scheme choices
  * Ship separate light/dark GTK palettes, with the edition dark scheme
  * Require matching GTK version in the Kubabbar Glass look package

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261102.2~sparky9~0 (2026-11-02)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * sparky-stereo-gtk: read back GSettings values in a separate process because a failed dconf commit can exit zero
  * sparky-stereo-gtk: show and retain failed configuration reads, GTK writes and xsettingsd reloads through sparky-stereo-problems, with messages in all nine languages
  * sparky-stereo-gtk: report when xsettingsd is absent and signal only the current user's daemon by PID
  * sparky-stereo-look-kubabbar-glass: require the matching GTK package version

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261030~sparky9~0 (2026-10-30)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * sparky-stereo-gtk: added the GTK theme sync entry's name and comment in Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese
  * sparky-stereo-look-kubabbar-glass: added the window decoration's name and comment in the same eight languages, the SDDM theme's name in German, French, Japanese, Korean, Brazilian Portuguese, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese and its German description
  * sparky-stereo-look-kubabbar-glass: added kubabbar-glass-style's German strings
  * sparky-stereo-look-kubabbar-glass: the README no longer links to design notes that are not public
